#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://cartpops.com"
msgstr "https://cartpops.com"

#: cartpops.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"The #1 WooCommerce cart drawer plugin. Boost conversions with a beautiful "
"slide-out cart, product recommendations, and free shipping meter."
msgstr ""
"Plugin cart drawer WooCommerce #1. Tingkatkan konversi dengan keranjang "
"slide-out yang menawan, rekomendasi produk, dan pengukur pengiriman gratis."

#: cartpops.php:56
msgid ""
"CartPops detected both the Free and Pro editions as active. CartPops was "
"paused; deactivate one edition and reload this page."
msgstr ""
"CartPops mendeteksi edisi Gratis dan Pro aktif secara bersamaan. CartPops "
"telah dijeda; nonaktifkan salah satu edisi dan muat ulang halaman ini."

#: cartpops.php:148
msgid ""
"CartPops could not safely verify upgrade state. CartPops was paused before "
"licensing initialization; reload this page or contact support."
msgstr ""
"CartPops tidak dapat memverifikasi status peningkatan dengan aman. CartPops "
"telah dijeda sebelum inisialisasi lisensi; muat ulang halaman ini atau "
"hubungi dukungan."

#: cartpops.php:406
msgid ""
"CartPops licensing could not initialize. Shared cart features remain "
"available, but paid features are paused. Reinstall the complete CartPops "
"package or contact support."
msgstr ""
"Lisensi CartPops tidak dapat diinisialisasi. Fitur keranjang bersama tetap "
"tersedia, tetapi fitur berbayar dijeda. Instal ulang paket lengkap CartPops "
"atau hubungi dukungan."

